Dear Lojban enthusiasts,

I am a recruiter for Lionbridge Technologies and would like to ask if any o=
f you would be willing to participate in a (well-paid!) project regarding t=
he Lojban language.

We are seeking to improve our understanding of how machines can learn to us=
e and respond to all kinds of languages. This process has already been done=
 for larger language groups, but usually the minority languages are neglect=
ed in modern technology.

You would have to:
-          Have very good skills in Lojban
-          Understand English instructions and guidelines
-          Have a computer and internet access
-          Have a PayPal account or be willing to create one

If you feel up to the task and are interested in joining our project, pleas=
e apply directly via email to me and I will set you up or answer any questi=
ons regarding the project!

Kind regards,
Stephanie Silvan

